ropolis","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-10-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=Take%20this%20to%20him.,I%20want%20to%20meet.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","license":null,"text":"\"Encounter at the Necropolis\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Oct 2008. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21-e4","era":null,"summary":"Eliza tells her fleshdoll to ready her armies for war.","participants":["eliza"],"location":"unx","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","order":159,"story_date":"2008-10-21","storyline":"Shards of Alara","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":20,"quote":"\"Get the others ready,\" Eliza told it. \"Form up for war.\"","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=%22Get%20the%20others%20ready%2C%22,%22Form%20up%20for%20war.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Encounter at the Necropolis","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-10-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=%22Get%20the%20others%20ready%2C%22,%22Form%20up%20for%20war.%22","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","license":null,"text":"\"Encounter